0">一边</span></p><p begin="1:48.641" end="1:52.393" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:48.641" end="1:48.986">这</span><span begin="1:48.986" end="1:49.577">歌里</span><span begin="1:49.577" end="1:49.856">的</span><span begin="1:49.856" end="1:50.730">细微末节</span><span begin="1:50.730" end="1:51.160">就算</span><span begin="1:51.304" end="1:51.628">都</span><span begin="1:51.628" end="1:52.393">体验</span></p><p begin="1:52.406" end="1:57.966" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:52.406" end="1:52.968">若想</span><span begin="1:52.968" end="1:53.838">真明白</span> <span begin="1:54.942" end="1:55.616">真要</span><span begin="1:55.616" end="1:56.156">好</span><span begin="1:56.156" end="1:56.533">几</span><span begin="1:56.533" end="1:57.966">年</span></p></div><div begin="2:27.986" end="2:42.375" itunes:songPart="Bridge"><p begin="2:27.986" end="2:32.990" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:27.986" end="2:28.718">回想</span><span begin="2:28.718" end="2:29.654">那一天</span> <span begin="2:29.886" end="2:30.828">喧闹</span><span begin="2:30.828" end="2:31.123">的</span><span begin="2:31.123" end="2:31.567">喜</span><span begin="2:31.567" end="2:32.990">宴</span></p><p begin="2:35.172" end="2:42.375" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.172" end="2:35.562">耳</span><span begin="2:35.562" end="2:35.898">边</span><span begin="2:35.898" end="2:36.854">响起的</span> <span begin="2:36.988" end="2:38.192">究竟是</span><span begin="2:38.192" end="2:38.850">序曲</span><span begin="2:39.155" end="2:39.647">或</span><span begin="2:39.647" end="2:42.375">完结篇</span></p></div><div begin="2:42.549" end="3:08.679" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="2:42.549" end="2:45.669" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:42.549" end="2:43.329">感情</span><span begin="2:43.483" end="2:44.405">不就是</span><span begin="2:44.405" end="2:44.810">你情</span><span begin="2:44.810" end="2:45.669">我愿</span></p><p begin="2:45.677" end="2:49.192" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:45